	"title"		"RegentFX Fast Boot (万象辉星启动加速)"
	"description"		"[h1]RegentFX Fast Boot(万象辉星启动加速)[/h1]

[i]Conditional boot-stall fix for RegentFX. It requires a specific load order, it does not work at every mod position, and it never reorders your mods.[/i]

[hr]

[h2]它做什么(条件生效,顺序很重要)[/h2]

实测背景(2026-09-11, 39 个 mod 环境):RegentFX v0.5.1 在 mod 初始化阶段同步预加载 32 个特效场景,占用约 4 秒(2026-09-15 复核:历史计时区间包含程序集/PCK/初始化的全部工作,不止预加载本身)。

本 mod 只在满足前置顺序时生效:
[list]
[*][b]硬性顺序要求[/b]:必须在游戏内模组列表把 RegentFXFastBoot 放在 RegentFX [b]上面[/b](加载器尊重用户的手动排序)。顺序不满足时,日志会如实报告 LATE-ORDER:本次启动不跳过任何内容、不做预热,启动卡顿(如发生)已经发生且无法撤回。
[*]顺序正确时:在 RegentFX 的程序集加载瞬间挂上方法绑定,等它的初始化器真正调用同步预加载入口时才拦截(此时 PCK 挂载、脚本注册、RegentFX 配置默认值都已完成)
[*]仅当 RegentFX 自己的 PreloadEffects 开关为开启时才会发生拦截;该开关关闭时本 mod 不做任何预热,保持原生关闭预加载的策略
[*]拦截后把相同的场景清单交给引擎自己的异步加载面(NAssetLoader/AssetLoadingSession)预热进 RegentFX 自己的缓存:同一时刻最多一个可选请求,只在主菜单空闲时提交,不抢占引擎必需资源的加载带宽;离开主菜单后不再提交新请求,已在途的请求观察到完成
[*]预热失败或未完成的场景由 RegentFX 原生懒加载路径兜底(VFXUtil.GenVFXNode 回落 PreloadManager.Cache),特效不会因此缺失;但这是回落路径,不是[b]永不失败[/b]的保证
[/list]

[h2]关于进战斗前缓存是否预热完成[/h2]

[list]
[*]第一场战斗前缓存是否已热[b]取决于时机[/b](机器速度、帧率、启动流程),本 mod 不对此作出保证
[*]日志会按阶段如实报告:ARMED / BOUND / INTERCEPTED / QUEUED / ATTACHED / COMPLETED / LATE-ORDER / FAILED / UNSUPPORTED,可据此验证模组顺序调整是否生效
[/list]

[h2]使用方法[/h2]

[list]
[*]订阅本 mod 与 [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747497501]RegentFX[/url]
[*]在游戏内模组列表把 RegentFXFastBoot 移到 RegentFX 上面(关键步骤,不可省略)
[*]未安装 RegentFX 时本 mod 保持待命,不做任何事
[/list]

[hr]

[h2]依赖[/h2]

[list]
[*][b]配合[/b]:[url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3747497501]RegentFX[/url](未安装则本 mod 无事可做)
[*]v0.2.0 起不再依赖 BaseLib(经二进制核查,本 mod 的 DLL 对 BaseLib 的运行时引用为零)
[/list]"
	"changenote"		"v0.2.0: lifecycle repair with an explicit early-order requirement. No longer advertised as order independent: RegentFXFastBoot must load BEFORE RegentFX (place it above RegentFX in the mod list). Binding now happens only in the AssemblyLoad callback (method binding only, no asset collection there); warm-up is queued only when the LoadScenes interception actually fires, which also preserves RegentFX PreloadEffects=false; the warmer attaches to the already-constructed NGame instead of patching its constructor. Late order is reported truthfully as LATE-ORDER with no suppression and no warm-up, and warm-up failures are reported as FAILED with the native lazy-loading path preserved. Removed the BaseLib dependency after verifying the DLL emits zero BaseLib references. Manifest version bumped to 0.2.0. Also in this build: RFX-2 scheduling (2026-09-15) - the warm-up no longer loads synchronously one scene per frame. Optional work now goes through the engine's own coordination surface (NAssetLoader.LoadInTheBackground with a single-path AssetLoadingSession), one request outstanding at a time, submitted only while the main menu is idle and always observed to completion once accepted, because Godot exposes no cancellation. The live NAssetLoader is resolved from the running NGame's tree rather than the Instance getter, which fabricates an unattached node before _Ready. The session is given a NULL asset cache on purpose: passing the shared one would let an optional failure mark an asset failed engine-wide and make RegentFX's lazy fallback throw. Task completion is not treated as load success - the resource must be a valid PackedScene that can instantiate before it is published. Leaving the menu is reported as a stop, never as a boot saving."
	"publishedfileid"		"3799305611"
}
